# Regression and audit coverage for WA Src Lane 2 (8 src/ @workaround sites)
#
# 1. indcall_try_then_member_2026_10_25 -> archive_file.spl (RETIRED tag; ?. is safe-nav by design)
# 2. mir_provider_optional_type_wrapper_segv_2026-10-14 -> cranelift_codegen_adapter.spl (ROOT-FIXED+RETIRED)
# 3. module_static_unresolved_initializer_2026-10-24 -> parser.spl (ROOT-FIXED+RETIRED tag; contract type preserved)
# 4. native_deferred_range_index_2026_10_11 -> physical_tld_v1.spl (ROOT-FIXED+RETIRED)
# 5. enum_payload_type_mismatch_untyped_map_2026-10-24 -> traits.spl (ROOT-FIXED+RETIRED)
# 6. mir_cross_module_struct_field_default_error_2026-11-19 -> host_linux_service_agent_v4.spl (ROOT-FIXED+STAGE2-GATED)
# 7. seed_coalesce_stateful_operand_twice_2026_10_12 -> fold_gen.spl & ast_semantic_value.spl (ROOT-FIXED+RETIRED)
# 8. cranelift_bare_return_in_valued_fn_verifier_2026-11-18 -> module_import_registration.spl (RETIRED tag; E-SFFI-016 fixed)

